CONGRATULATIONS TO ALL THE CONTESTANT 
This showcase features four emerging student designers who were selected from over 50 applicants across schools including FIT, Parsons, Berkeley College, and LIM. Their capsule collections are inspired by the theme “Threads of Eatonville – Past, Present & Forward”, spotlighting one of America’s first self-governing Black towns.

This initiative is presented in partnership with Eatonville Rising and The Association to Preserve the Eatonville Community (P.E.C.), with support from Orange County Florida’s Arts & Cultural Affairs Program. It reflects my deep commitment to mentorship and empowering the next generation of African and Diasporic design voices.

